+
+# Rental service: equipment, quote, book
+
+Export `createRentalService()` from `src/index.ts`: an in-memory service with `addEquipment`, `quote`, `book`.
+
+Rules: money in integer euro cents; times ISO-8601 UTC; whole days only (midnight UTC start and end, end is
+the start of the day after the last day); no overlapping bookings of one item; `quote`/`book` throw on unknown
+item or invalid period, `book` also when the item is not free. Total = days x dailyPrice.
+
+Out of scope: cancellation (policy: under 24 h before start, no refund; otherwise full refund — for later).
